Hmmm....try wearing a ring of adornment.  They will steal that first.  
Otherwise, just avoid them.  I have found that most of them are sleeping
or something when I find them, so I don't wake them up!!  This means no
battles in the room the nymph is in!!  And don't kick any doors, as this
will wake them also.  The only problem with that is that you don't know if
there is a nymph in the room you are about to kick the door down to.  Try
quaffing a potion of detect monsters.  that is the best way.

